  contentsAnswer: Display samples for a shop window. Hollow display shells, in foam.
    The real goods arrive next week.
  weightAnswer: Five kilos at most, including the bag. There is no solid merchandise
    in it.
  metalAnswer: No metal. They are painted hollow shapes, not working equipment.
  packingAnswer: Firmly wedged in foam. I do not want the painted surfaces touching.
  responseAnswer: It ought to be quiet. Nothing loose, no mechanism.
  authorReasoning: 'Quiet carrier: 11.8 kg conflicts with the confident lightweight
    hollow-display claim. Low metal and an almost still pulse do not exonerate it.
    Does not require removed balance test; false certainty would still be a player
    error.'
